[[0,1354751,0,3,9,-6,"2016-10-19T01:02:02","eagleshigh","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>An <a href=\"http://www.nationaljournal.com/twentysixteen/2015/09/02/1-easy-way-donald-trump-could-have-been-even-richer-doing-nothing\">analysis</a> suggests that Trump would’ve been a billionaire even if he’d never had a career in real estate, and had instead thrown his father’s inheritance into a index fund that tracked the market. His wealth, in other words, isn’t because of his brains. It’s because he’s a Trump….That’s not really impressive. Worse, it suggests that his success is almost entirely the result of having inherited money from his father. His own actions might have even cost him money.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.vox.com/2015/9/2/9248963/donald-trump-index-fund\">http://www.vox.com/2015/9/2/9248963/donald-trump-index-fund</a></p>","The truth about Trump's wealth.","","whatever"],[1,6597686,0,3,0,3,"2016-10-19T01:24:19","Spaceballs-1","",[],"<p>He could have been even richer if instead of creating jobs and tangible assets he used his money to influence politicians and subvert society. </p>\n<p>But not everyone can get a leg up by selling Jews to Nazis during WW2.</p>"],[1,6597727,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-19T01:31:52","sinjinsmythe","",[],"<p>I had read this before too, and it actually is mathematically true, HOWEVER, (and that is a big however) hindsight investment analysis is always easy, yet completely worthless. No one could know back in 1970's or whenever Trump started that he possibly could have made more money in passive investing (which didn't even exist really back then anyway, since ETF's and index funds are a relatively new (late 90's early 00's) vehicle. Basically, anyone can say I would've made more money if I invested in X vs Y, 40 years later.</p>\n<p>TLDR, Hindsight is always 20/20</p>"],[1,6597832,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-19T01:48:25","brandon816","",[],"<p>Meh, I would've been a millionaire if I threw my weight into bitcoin when it came out.</p>"],[1,6598081,0,0,2,-2,"2016-10-19T02:25:38","Antiracist2","",[],"<p><a href=\"http://archive.is/MyGCU\">TRIANGLE ON SPHERE!</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://voat.co/user/Crensch\">@Crensch</a> </p>"]]
