[[0,1354755,0,141,1,140,"2016-10-19T01:04:26","pcdude","",[],"","Elections Expert: \"We Now Have 4 Million Ineligible and Dead Voters on American Voter Rolls\"","http://www.thegatewaypundit.com/2016/10/elections-expert-now-4-million-ineligible-dead-voters-american-voter-rolls-video/","politics"],[1,6598160,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-19T02:37:53","downvoatdumbshit","",[],"<p>“Oh no, the dead have risen and they're voting Republican.” --Lisa Simpson</p>"],[2,6598208,6598160,5,0,5,"2016-10-19T02:45:53","Guttersnipe","",[],"<p>Yeah, a lie written by <em>the Simpsons</em> writers -- but then of course they are in the business of comedy.</p>\n<p>Meanwhile in real life 2016, as Rudy Giuliani pointed out the other day, &quot;<em>most dead people vote Democrat</em>&quot;.</p>"],[1,6598256,0,9,0,9,"2016-10-19T02:54:10","Guttersnipe","[e]",[],"<p>I don't think the registrations are all that important. Notice that today there are no posts on Voat talking about George Soros' control of US Voting Systems.</p>\n<p>This morning I posted information regarding the fact that the whole family of Voting Systems controlled by Georgi adds up to 70% of the equipment that all US voters must use on Nov 8th. The post took off for about an hour and hit the first page, but then something happened and it sunk into obscurity. </p>\n<p>It is Not just me -- after two or three days of growing interest in the subject, today Voat mysteriously had not a single post about Soros being in charge of elections IT systems <em>Smartmatic</em> and <em>Scytl</em>.</p>\n<p>Nobody's links about it made the cut.</p>\n<p>What (((they))) don't want us to discuss is key. We can go ahead and talk about Hillary's Hemorrhoids all we want, but we are now forbidden from talking about Soros and the voting machines.</p>"],[2,6599241,6598256,1,0,1,"2016-10-19T05:45:56","Jaegerjaques","",[],"<p>I'm thinking the fake voter registrations are just a red herring to keep the less naive goyim busy while they rig the election via other means. Who cares if they have 20 or 200 million dead voters if they are the they 'counting' the votes? They can make up whatever the fuck they want and because they control the media as well to rig the polls they can claim legitimacy. Because they and their cronies control language and have been pushing the 'conspiracy theorist' meme for years they can discredit all who question them, and because they now control the government they can jail all those who oppose them. Social media will soon be completely unusable for any kind of legitimate discussion or spread of anti-government memes because Zuckerfucker and his palls keep implementing more and more advanced algorithms to censor opposing views and push a constant flow of mindless trivial disinformation. And because Obongo also gave the internet to the UN, as soon as they can get away with it they'll instantly shut down any hate speech AKA free speech site.</p>\n<p>You know, they're really not leaving us with much options here...</p>"],[1,6598492,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-19T03:28:08","Aldo","",[],"<p>So have the dead been actually voting or are they just on the voting rolls because of slow and inefficient state governments?</p>"],[2,6598641,6598492,1,0,1,"2016-10-19T03:52:00","pcdude","",[],"<p>Someone is keeping them on the roles. In a lot of states, failure to vote for a period of time or not voting in a presidential election gets you removed. If someone is staying on for very long after a period of inactivity, then someone is re-registering them or voting in their place.</p>"],[1,6598862,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-19T04:25:36","OnlyMyLifeMatters","",[],"<p>Crazy stuff.</p>"],[1,6598919,0,3,0,3,"2016-10-19T04:35:48","newoldwave","",[],"<p>For some inexplicable reason the dead voters all vote Democrat. If they didn't while they were alive, they do now.</p>"]]
